    {
      "attempt": 2,
      "reason": "Attempt 1 was not accepted: the worker stored the invalid-save validation failure only in a non-admin-visible diagnostic property, so ADR-016 clause 4's requirement to surface the failure to the administrator was unmet. The user was asked and explicitly required an admin-visible surfacing. jellyfin-expert verified the supported mechanism (MediaBrowser.Model.Activity.IActivityManager activity-log entry), and architecture-reviewer recommended recording it as ADR-021 with a plugin-owned adapter and a SEC-9 item."
    },
    {
      "attempt": 3,
      "reason": "Attempt 2 passed implementation review but the independent security review reproduced MEDIUM defect SEC-9.3-01 (non-atomic Plugin.UpdateConfiguration allowed concurrent saves to diverge the running snapshot from plugin.Configuration and persisted XML, losing a valid save including a webhook-secret rotation). The worker reworked to validate-before-persist plus a per-plugin lock and removed the restore path."
    },
